# Dev-only tools â€” kept locally, never part of the website (Deepak,
# 2026-10-15: "gitignore â€¦ everything that isn't what we see on the
# website"). The build's only input is index.html; none of these are
# imported by it. Each still runs locally with `npm run dev`.
#   the video pipeline: the studio, the video kit, each topic's video.ts and
#   the scaffold templates, the render/voice/topic scripts, their runbooks
/studio.html
/src/studio/
/src/topics/videoKit/**
